            "top_image_width": 100,
            "text_color": "text-dark",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Find Tree Trimmer Tools in Grand Junction, CO",
            "text": "<p>Tired of using garden tools that don’t give you clean results or wear you out halfway through the job? Rivendell Distribution hears that a lot from homeowners and growers here in Grand Junction, where the mix of dry soil, overgrown branches, and thick hedges can be tough to manage. That’s why we’ve built a collection of pruning tools specifically designed to handle the yard work common in Western Colorado. </p><p>We’ve got<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Hand+Saws\" target=\"_blank\"> hand saws</a> for cutting thick branches,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Hedge+Shears\" target=\"_blank\"> hedge shears</a> for shaping,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Tree+Pruners\" target=\"_blank\"> tree pruners</a> for tall limbs, and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Snips\" target=\"_blank\"> snips</a> for working around small plants and flowers. You’ll also find long handle tools, striking tools, and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Replacement+Parts\" target=\"_blank\"> replacement parts</a> so your equipment stays ready for the next task. We delivery straight to Grand Junction and surrounding areas.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary btn--small",
            "bg_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
